{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792762380, "covers_from": "2026-10-23T13:33:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-23T13:34:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792762440, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-23T13:33:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61942, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "萬華區華西街等夜市老鼠很多，有時候在騎樓路上都會看到，現在俄羅斯鼠疫風險上升，希望能協助處理", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.61,942", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T13:33:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44367, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "我常在大稻埕的迪化街那邊工作，因為國內外觀光客很多，需要改善多些公共廁所的數量及垃圾桶的問題。", "display_name": "大同代表 No.44,367", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T13:33:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40567, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望對市場豬肉規定用低溫冷藏，凌晨屠宰場丟在攤子上，6點攤商才到老鼠先食用了，食安高溫變質等參考國外", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.40,567", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T13:33:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38558, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "體育", "content": "大巨蛋漏水又有老鼠，然後之後還要辦辦理那個什麼國際賽希望可以把那個漏水跟老鼠改善，否則讓外國人看笑話", "display_name": "信義代表 No.38,558", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 44367, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.44,367", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 40567, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.40,567", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 38558, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.38,558", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 70140, "sprite_key": "penguin_cu